gin="00:38.040" end="00:38.304">that </span><span begin="00:38.304" end="00:38.498">I </span><span begin="00:38.498" end="00:38.904">shouldn't </span><span begin="00:38.904" end="00:39.164">say</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.164" end="00:41.962"><span begin="00:39.164" end="00:39.359">I </span><span begin="00:39.359" end="00:39.635">opened </span><span begin="00:39.635" end="00:39.819">up </span><span begin="00:39.819" end="00:40.020">a </span><span begin="00:40.020" end="00:40.339">letter </span><span begin="00:40.339" end="00:40.539">of </span><span begin="00:40.539" end="00:40.802">bills </span><span begin="00:40.802" end="00:41.115">that </span><span begin="00:41.115" end="00:41.313">I </span><span begin="00:41.313" end="00:41.578">didn't </span><span begin="00:41.578" end="00:41.962">pay</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.962" end="00:44.630"><span begin="00:41.962" end="00:42.146">They </span><span begin="00:42.146" end="00:42.330">were </span><span begin="00:42.330" end="00:42.498">due </span><span begin="00:42.498" end="00:42.690">in </span><span begin="00:42.690" end="00:43.066">April </span><span begin="00:43.066" end="00:43.250">but </span><span begin="00:43.250" end="00:43.623">now </span><span begin="00:43.623" end="00:43.894">it's </span><span begin="00:43.894" end="00:44.110">the </span><span begin="00:44.110" end="00:44.302">end </span><span begin="00:44.302" end="00:44.478">of </span><span begin="00:44.478" end="00:44.630">May</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.630" end="00:47.634"><span begin="00:44.630" end="00:44.782">It's </span><span begin="00:44.782" end="00:44.934">sad </span><span begin="00:44.934" end="00:45.094">that </span><span begin="00:45.094" end="00:47.634">I</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.634" end="00:50.021"><span begin="00:47.634" end="00:47.850">Prepare </span><span begin="00:47.850" end="00:48.034">to </span><span begin="00:48.034" end="00:48.189">be </span><span begin="00:48.189" end="00:48.397">so </span><span begin="00:48.397" end="00:48.613">young </span><span begin="00:48.613" end="00:48.773">'til </span><span begin="00:48.773" end="00:48.957">the </span><span begin="00:48.957" end="00:49.253">end </span><span begin="00:49.253" end="00:49.445">of </span><span begin="00:49.445" end="00:50.021">time</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.021" end="00:52.997"><span begin="00:50.021" end="00:50.269">I </span><span begin="00:50.269" end="00:52.997">realized</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.997" end="00:55.487"><span begin="00:52.997" end="00:53.189">When </span><span begin="00:53.189" end="00:53.325">I </span><span begin="00:53.325" end="00:53.526">struggled </span><span begin="00:53.526" end="00:53.726">to </span><span begin="00:53.726" end="00:53.902">get </span><span begin="00:53.902" end="00:54.134">out </span><span begin="00:54.134" end="00:54.325">of </span><span begin="00:54.325" end="00:54.518">my </span><span begin="00:54.518" end="00:54.862">room </span><span begin="00:54.862" end="00:55.166">last </span><span begin="00:55.166" end="00:55.487">night</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.487" end="00:58.632"><span begin="00:55.487" end="00:55.652">Got </span><span begin="00:55.652" end="00:55.820">on </span><span begin="00:55.820" end="00:56.016">my </span><span begin="00:56.016" end="00:58.632">phone</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.632" end="01:01.091"><span begin="00:58.632" end="00:58.815">And </span><span begin="00:58.815" end="00:59.008">I </span><span begin="00:59.008" end="00:59.216">begged </span><span begin="00:59.216" end="00:59.431">for </span><span begin="00:59.431" end="00:59.681">my </span><span begin="00:59.681" end="00:59.852">brother </span><span begin="00:59.852" end="01:00.020">to </span><span begin="01:00.020" end="01:00.341">take </span><span begin="01:00.341" end="01:00.628">me </span><span begin="01:00.628" end="01:01.091">home</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.091" end="01:04.212"><span begin="01:01.091" end="01:01.275">When </span><span begin="01:01.275" end="01:01.428">he </span><span begin="01:01.428" end="01:01.667">asked </span><span begin="01:01.667" end="01:04.212">why</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.212" end="01:07.060"><span begin="01:04.212" end="01:04.404">I </span><span begin="01:04.404" end="01:04.573">said </span><span begin="01:04.573" end="01:04.740">I'd </span><span begin="01:04.740" end="01:04.948">rather </span><span begin="01:04.948" end="01:05.284">be </span><span begin="01:05.284" end="01:05.508">here </span><span begin="01:05.508" end="01:07.060">alone</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.060" end="01:09.876"><span begin="01:07.060" end="01:07.236">I </span><span begin="01:07.236" end="01:07.396">went </span><span begin="01:07.396" end="01:07.557">to </span><span begin="01:07.557" end="01:07.756">the </span><span begin="01:07.756" end="01:08.220">doctor </span><span begin="01:08.220" end="01:09.876">again</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.876" end="01:12.382"><span begin="01:09.876" end="01:10.036">Said </span><span begin="01:10.036" end="01:10.188">I </span><span begin="01:10.188" end="01:10.396">was </span><span begin="01:10.396" end="01:10.804">behind </span><span begin="01:10.804" end="01:10.980">on </span><span begin="01:10.980" end="01:11.196">my </span><span begin="01:11.196" end="01:12.382">rent</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.382" end="01:15.069"><span begin="01:12.382" end="01:12.548">He </span><span begin="01:12.548" end="01:12.695">told </span><span begin="01:12.695" end="01:12.860">me </span><span begin="01:12.860" end="01:13.023">it's </span><span begin="01:13.023" end="01:13.196">not </span><span begin="01:13.196" end="01:13.388">a </span><span begin="01:13.388" end="01:13.876">problem </span><span begin="01:13.876" end="01:14.052">for </span><span begin="01:14.052" end="01:15.069">him</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.069" end="01:17.958"><span begin="01:15.069" end="01:15.223">I </sp